</table>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table B: </span>INT8-Quantized results on VBench. FPS is measured on a single NVIDIA 5090 GPU.</figcaption>
